  dialogues:
  - doctorQuestion: 'Hello [name], so I take it that you''re currently experiencing
      [symptoms], correct? Are you feeling anything else?  '
    patientReply: "I\u2019ve been feeling weird with all the [symptoms] but I still
      wanna train. Thoughts? "
    doctorResponsePositive: "Let\u2019s see if it\u2019s serious first. Any other
      symptoms?"
    patientReactionPositive: Na-da, none!
    doctorResponseNegative: All your training goes to your body, none to your brain.
    patientReactionNegative: Woah bro, you did not.
  - doctorQuestion: 'Hello [name], so I take it that you''re currently experiencing
      [symptoms], correct? Are you feeling anything else?  '
    patientReply: 'Do push-ups cure [symptoms]? '
    doctorResponsePositive: "Maybe not push-ups, but staying active helps. Let\u2019s
      check everything first!"
    patientReactionPositive: Alright, you're the boss!
    doctorResponseNegative: "That\u2019s the dumbest thing I\u2019ve heard today"
    patientReactionNegative: Ouch. No need to attack me.
  - doctorQuestion: 'Hello [name], so I take it that you''re currently experiencing
      [symptoms], correct? Are you feeling anything else?  '
    patientReply: 'I passed out mid-rep then the next thing I know, they were saying
      I got [symptoms]! What''s that supposed to mean? '
    doctorResponsePositive: "Yeah, that\u2019s a sign to rest. Anything else did
      they tell you?"
    patientReactionPositive: Hmm... None that I remember.
    doctorResponseNegative: "That\u2019s what happens when you overtrain."
    patientReactionNegative: "Tch. Guess I\u2019ll just push through"
  - doctorQuestion: 'Hello [name], so I take it that you''re currently experiencing
      [symptoms], correct? Are you feeling anything else?  '
    patientReply: "Do you think I\u2019ll break my personal record despite the [symptoms]? "
    doctorResponsePositive: "Let\u2019s get you healthy first, then you can smash
      that record!"
    patientReactionPositive: The Olympics won't know what's coming!
    doctorResponseNegative: "If you don\u2019t rest, you\u2019ll just get worse."
    patientReactionNegative: Always rest, ugh.
